      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 305413311022433172, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Welcome to <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Hand of Aeralon</color></font-weight>,
        a <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>turn-based tactical RPG</color></font-weight>
        with <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>card- and party-driven combat</color></font-weight>.
        \n

        You play as <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Archmage Aeralon</color></font-weight>,
        an unseen ruler bound by secrecy. Unable to act directly, you command a party
        of heroes on grid-based battlefields and influence combat through powerful
        arcane {card}Cards{/card}. \n

        Nimurath is under siege by the <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Nere</color></font-weight>,
        empowered by <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Magor, God of Chaos</color></font-weight>.
        To stop his return, you must guide your heroes through a series of increasingly
        dangerous encounters. \n

        Each battle is part of a larger run. Heroes
        can die permanently, resources are limited, and enemies grow stronger. Victory
        demands smart positioning, careful planning, and decisive use of {ability}abilities{/ability}
        and {card}cards{/card}. \n

        This tutorial will teach you the fundamentals.
        Every decision matters.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 341947027987992416, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Before combat begins, you must place your heroes on the battlefield.
        Click <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>(M1)</color></font-weight> on a character
        to select them, then click <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>(M1)</color></font-weight>
        on any green starting tile to place them. \n

        Positioning matters.
        Frontline fighters should protect vulnerable allies, while ranged heroes
        benefit from distance and clear lines of sight. You may freely reposition
        characters during this phase. There is no penalty for experimentation.\n

        When
        all characters are placed and you are satisfied with your formation, press
        <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Spacebar</color></font-weight> or click <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Start
        Combat</color></font-weight> to begin.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 373449785749162704, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.y
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 373449785749162704, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMin.y
      value: 0
