    - target: {fileID: 1441340756562220977, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Hovering over an {ability}ability{/ability} opens its tooltip, displaying
        detailed information. If you hover over a tooltip <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>long
        enough</color></font-weight>, it will <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>lock
        in place</color></font-weight>, allowing you to move the cursor freely and
        inspect additional details without the tooltip disappearing. The hover time
        required to lock a tooltip can be <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>adjusted
        in the Settings Menu</color></font-weight>. \n

        Highlighted <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>keywords</color></font-weight>
        inside tooltips can be hovered over to reveal deeper explanations of mechanics
        such as Buffs, Debuffs, or special rules. Mastering keywords is essential
        for understanding more complex interactions. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
