    - target: {fileID: 3699915845686244086, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "This is the <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Info Panel</color></font-weight>,
        here you\u2019ll find the character\u2019s name, class, traits, stats and
        all status effects currently affecting them.\\n\r\nEvery character has:\r\n
        \u2022 <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>One positive trait</color></font-weight>\r\n
        \u2022 <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>One negative trait</color></font-weight>\\n\r\nTraits
        can modify stats, alter {ability}ability{/ability} behavior, or introduce
        conditional effects.\\n\r\nClass-specific traits are more rare and often
        more powerful positive traits, shaping unique playstyles.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3710907245535460356, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Here you can also view a character\u2019s full stat breakdown, including
        {heal}Health{/heal}, {physical_damage}Damage{/physical_damage}, <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Initiative</color></font-weight>,
        and <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Movement Points (MP)</color></font-weight>;
        which can all be <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>modified</color></font-weight>
        by <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>traits</color></font-weight> and <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>status
        effects</color></font-weight>.\\n\r\n{heal}Health{/heal} determines how much
        {physical_damage}damage{/physical_damage} a character can take. If a character\u2019s
        {heal}Health{/heal} reaches <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>0</color></font-weight>,
        they are <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>permanently dead</color></font-weight>.
        {heal}Health{/heal} can be restored through {ability}abilities{/ability},
        {card}cards{/card}, or in the shop.\\n\r\n{physical_damage}Damage{/physical_damage}
        represents the character\u2019s base {physical_damage}damage{/physical_damage}
        value. {ability}Ability{/ability} {physical_damage}damage{/physical_damage}
        multipliers scale from this stat. \\n\r\n<font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Initiative</color></font-weight>
        determines <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>turn order</color></font-weight>
        each round; characters act from <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>highest to
        lowest</color></font-weight>, and the order <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>updates</color></font-weight>
        if <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Initiative changes</color></font-weight>
        during combat.\\n\r\n<font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Movement Points (MP)</color></font-weight>
        determine how many tiles a character can move during their turn."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3787342098017550497, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 1
